// Prerequisites of the rust/avoidable-closure check for this package (package/linter/monochromatic-lint/README.md,
// section "Prerequisite manifest"): a Qt 6 qmake, because cxx-qt-build runs `qmake -query` to locate Qt.
// qt-build-utils takes QMAKE when it is set and otherwise the first PATH candidate that works, trying qmake6,
// qmake-qt5 and qmake in that order, and this check's own probe searches qmake6 and qmake.
{
  "qmake": true,
}
